  "readme": [
    {
      "section": "Introduction",
      "text": "<div align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"icon.svg\" width=\"96\" alt=\"Rice on a Stick\">"
    },
    {
      "section": "白饭钓竿",
      "text": "中文 | [English](README.en.md)\n\n[](https://github.com/deepseek-ai/deepseek-harness) [](https://www.npmjs.com/package/dsh-rice-on-a-stick)\n\n[](https://github.com/Leawind/dsh-rice-on-a-stick/releases) [](https://github.com/Leawind/dsh-rice-on-a-stick/commits/main)\n\n一个将控制 dsh ([DeepSeek Harness](https://github.com/deepseek-ai/deepseek-harness)) 的能力暴露为 MCP 和内置工具的插件。\n\n</div>"
    },
    {
      "section": "白饭钓竿",
      "text": "- **控制会话**：新建、发送、排队、分叉、归档与恢复、切换模型等\n  - 可配置为只允许调用方使用特定模型，也可为模型提供商和模型编写描述提供给调用方\n- **像网页用户一样与会话交互**：调用方通过本插件可像 web 端用户一样处理权限审批与提问\n- **dsh 端点直通**：调用 dsh 的远程访问端点，端点策略三档可配：允许、需审批、拒绝\n- **dsh 自己也能用**：这些能力同时注册为 dsh 的内置工具，本 dsh 实例无需额外接入 MCP\n- **安全默认**：默认只监听本机，可配置访问令牌。\n\n> [!WARNING]\n>\n> - 未启用认证时，任何能访问对应端口的本机进程都可以驱动 dsh\n> - 这个插件会对调用者暴露本机代码执行能力，默认只监听 `127.0.0.1`"
    },
    {
      "section": "环境要求",
      "text": "- dsh `0.2.1-rc.5` 及以上。图形界面（侧栏“白饭钓竿”页）和完整的会话功能需要 web 或 desktop 版 dsh\n- MCP 客户端需支持 Streamable HTTP，只支持 stdio 的客户端需要自行桥接"
    },
    {
      "section": "安装",
      "text": "通过 npm 安装：\n\n```sh\ndsh plugin --profile web add dsh-rice-on-a-stick\n```\n\n通过源码安装：\n\n```sh\ngit clone https://github.com/Leawind/dsh-rice-on-a-stick\ncd dsh-rice-on-a-stick\nnpm install\nnpm run build\ndsh plugin --profile web add link:."
    },
    {
      "section": "监听源码变动并实时构建",
      "text": "npm run dev\n```\n\n卸载：\n\n```sh\ndsh plugin --profile web remove dsh-rice-on-a-stick\n```"
    },
    {
      "section": "接入 MCP 客户端",
      "text": "MCP server 默认监听 `http://127.0.0.1:5642/mcp`，传输方式为 Streamable HTTP；可在设置中启用认证。"
    },
    {
      "section": "配置",
      "text": "所有配置都可在 dsh 侧栏的\"白饭钓竿\"页里改。"
    },
    {
      "section": "发送消息",
      "text": "`session_send` 向会话发消息。目标会话正在运行时须显式选择投递方式：排队（等当前回合结束）或插话（在步边界注入并延长本轮）；空闲时二者等价，运行中不指定会直接失败。"
    },
    {
      "section": "观察会话状态",
      "text": "`session_poll` 批量观察会话状态：状态、排队数、待回答项与最后一条消息。"
    },
    {
      "section": "处理权限审批与提问",
      "text": "像网页用户一样处理权限审批（`approval_list` / `approval_answer`）与回答模型的提问（`question_list` / `question_answer`）。"
    },
    {
      "section": "调用 dsh 的远程访问端点",
      "text": "发现（`endpoint_describe`）并调用（`endpoint_call`）dsh 的远程访问端点，机制见 [docs/endpoint-passthrough.zh.md](docs/endpoint-passthrough.zh.md)。"
    },
    {
      "section": "感谢",
      "text": "初始源码复制自 [`chushixixin/dsh-harness-mcp-server`](https://github.com/chushixixin/dsh-harness-mcp-server)（MIT，感谢 @chushixixin）。"
    },
    {
      "section": "Introduction",
      "text": "<div align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"icon.svg\" width=\"96\" alt=\"Rice on a Stick\">"
    },
    {
      "section": "Rice on a Stick",
      "text": "[中文](README.md) | English\n\n[](https://github.com/deepseek-ai/deepseek-harness) [](https://www.npmjs.com/package/dsh-rice-on-a-stick)\n\n[](https://github.com/Leawind/dsh-rice-on-a-stick/releases) [](https://github.com/Leawind/dsh-rice-on-a-stick/commits/main)\n\nA plugin that exposes control over dsh ([DeepSeek Harness](https://github.com/deepseek-ai/deepseek-harness)) as MCP and built-in tools.\n\n</div>"
    },
    {
      "section": "Rice on a Stick",
      "text": "- **Control sessions**: create, send, queue, fork, archive and restore, switch models, etc.\n  - Can be configured so that callers may only use specific models; descriptions for model providers and models can also be written and provided to callers\n- **Interact with sessions like a web user**: through this plugin, callers can handle permission approvals and questions just like a web user\n- **dsh endpoint passthrough**: call dsh's remote access endpoints; endpoint policy has three configurable levels: allow, require approval, deny\n- **dsh itself can use it too**: these capabilities are also registered as dsh's built-in tools, so this dsh instance needs no extra MCP setup\n- **Secure by default**: listens only on localhost by default, with a configurable access token."
    },
    {
      "section": "Rice on a Stick",
      "text": "> [!WARNING]\n>\n> - When authentication is disabled, any local process that can access the corresponding port can drive dsh\n> - This plugin exposes local code execution capability to callers and listens only on `127.0.0.1` by default"
    },
    {
      "section": "Requirements",
      "text": "- dsh `0.2.1-rc.5` or later. The graphical interface (the \"Rice on a Stick\" page in the sidebar) and full session functionality require the web or desktop version of dsh\n- MCP clients must support Streamable HTTP; clients that only support stdio need to bridge it themselves"
    },
    {
      "section": "Installation",
      "text": "Install via npm:\n\n```sh\ndsh plugin --profile web add dsh-rice-on-a-stick\n```\n\nInstall from source:\n\n```sh\ngit clone https://github.com/Leawind/dsh-rice-on-a-stick\ncd dsh-rice-on-a-stick\nnpm install\nnpm run build\ndsh plugin --profile web add link:."
    },
    {
      "section": "Watch source changes and build in real time",
      "text": "npm run dev\n```\n\nUninstall:\n\n```sh\ndsh plugin --profile web remove dsh-rice-on-a-stick\n```"
    },
    {
      "section": "Connecting to MCP clients",
      "text": "The MCP server listens on `http://127.0.0.1:5642/mcp` by default, with Streamable HTTP as the transport; authentication can be enabled in settings."
    },
    {
      "section": "Configuration",
      "text": "All configuration can be changed on the \"Rice on a Stick\" page in the dsh sidebar."
    },
    {
      "section": "Sending messages",
      "text": "`session_send` sends a message to a session. If the target session is running, the delivery mode must be chosen explicitly: queue (wait until the current turn ends) or steer (inject at a step boundary and extend this turn). When the session is idle, the two are equivalent; omitting the mode while the session is running fails directly."
    },
    {
      "section": "Observing session state",
      "text": "`session_poll` observes multiple sessions at once: state, queue length, pending answers and the last message."
    },
    {
      "section": "Handling permission approvals and questions",
      "text": "Handle permission approvals (`approval_list` / `approval_answer`) and answer the model's questions (`question_list` / `question_answer`) just like a web user."
    },
    {
      "section": "Calling dsh's remote access endpoints",
      "text": "Discover (`endpoint_describe`) and call (`endpoint_call`) dsh's remote access endpoints; for the mechanism, see [docs/endpoint-passthrough.zh.md](docs/endpoint-passthrough.zh.md)."
    },
